bitsandbytes (MIT License)
--------------------------
https://github.com/bitsandbytes-foundation/bitsandbytes

poros/moe/quant.py reimplements, in PyTorch, the NF4 quantization format of
bitsandbytes 0.50.0 (quantize_4bit, the 4-bit and blockwise dequantize compute,
and the CPU kernel's quantize_cpu_impl and build_quantize_lut for the 8-bit
double quantization), so that its bytes match bitsandbytes'. poros/moe/kernels.py
decodes that format on the GPU.

