transformers (Apache License 2.0)
---------------------------------
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
Copyright The HuggingFace Inc. team and the authors of its model code.

Modified from transformers' code, under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the
same license as Poros, LICENSE):

- poros/core/fused/__init__.py, _layer_forward: transformers' Qwen2DecoderLayer
  and Qwen2Attention forward, restructured to run the fused adapter kernels.
- poros/moe/modules.py, the reference expert compute (_experts_compute): the math
  of transformers' Qwen3MoeExperts.forward (and its sibling families'), batched
  over groups of experts.
- docs/validation/moe/4090/scripts (refcheck_hooks.py, prec64.py), in the benchmark
  logs' repository (github.com/Caistro-Labs/poros-benchmarks): transformers'
  Qwen3MoeExperts loop, as the stock arm of a check and in fp64.
- poros/moe/inkling2/ (modeling.py, config.py, and the expert formats and checkpoint
  names in codec.py): the Inkling 2 Mini implementation of transformers 5.24.0
  (models/inkling2_loop/, and the Inkling 2 entries of conversion_mapping.py and
  core_model_loading.py), Copyright 2026 the HuggingFace Team, rewritten as a decoder
  run by visits.

